eup_test.eup is Mondschein.eup by Aya (FM Towns Euphony), from Modland (Euphony/Aya/Mondschein/Mondschein.eup), taken 2026-11-05 from https://modland.com/pub/modules/Euphony/Aya/Mondschein/Mondschein.eup. The tune belongs to its composer; Modland states no licence for it. The file is used unchanged, only as an eup-decode test fixture (row I701). No .FMB/.PMB companion banks are shipped, so the test hears default FM voices.
